              "jcr:created": "Mon Oct 12 2026 15:48:47 GMT+0000",
              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Tuesday, November 17</span></span></span></p>\n<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Evidence related to turn &amp; positioning systems</span></span></h2>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Oct 20 2026 19:20:50 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
              "textIsRich": "true"
            },
            "text": {
              "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
              "jcr:createdBy": "user-f123ca2978@example.invalid",
              "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
              "jcr:created": "Wed May 17 2023 14:56:12 GMT+0000",
              "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Presented by&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Jan Powers, PhD, RN, CCNS, CCRN, NE-BC, EBP-C, FCNS, FCCM, FAAN</span></span></p>\n<p>Pressure injury prevention remains a key priority across patient care. Join pressure injury prevention expert Jan Powers for a discussion on turning and positioning practices, common implementation challenges and current evidence related to patient repositioning. Through clinical examples and expert insight, participants will explore practical considerations for supporting pressure injury prevention efforts.<br>\n</p>\n<p>Objectives:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Understand the need for effective turning in hospitalized patients.</li>\n<li>Identify mechanisms to achieve improved turning and compliance.</li>\n<li>Review evidence related to turn and positioning systems.<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">12:30 p.m. ET</span></span></span></p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Oct 20 2026 19:21:15 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
              "textIsRich": "true"
            },
